    "PlantCare Plus is a broad-spectrum insecticide designed for all plant types. It effectively eliminates sap-sucking and leaf-eating insects, promoting healthy plant growth. Recommended dilution is 5–10 ml per liter of water.": "PlantCare Plus is a broad-spectrum insecticide designed for all plant types. It effectively eliminates sap-sucking and leaf-eating insects, promoting healthy plant growth. Recommended dilution is 5–10 ml per liter of water.",
    "Acelan 20SL is a neonicotinoid insecticide containing Acetamiprid 20SL. It effectively controls sucking pests, especially aphids and whiteflies, by interrupting their neural transmission, leading to paralysis and death. Acelan is particularly effective on cotton, vegetables, orchards, and tobacco crops. The recommended dosage is 250 ml per acre.": "Acelan 20SL is a neonicotinoid insecticide containing Acetamiprid 20SL. It effectively controls sucking pests, especially aphids and whiteflies, by interrupting their neural transmission, leading to paralysis and death. Acelan is particularly effective on cotton, vegetables, orchards, and tobacco crops. The recommended dosage is 250 ml per acre.",
